Z||000000||anthony_86gt||02-14-2001||03:51 PM||||I need more bass in my fiero.  I have new 4x6s, some cheap 4x10 jensons, and a crappy 8"sub behind my seat.  I am planning on getting a new 8" sub but i dont want to spend to much $$$.  which sub should i get, and are the pioneers worth $99, or should i just keep the 4x10s that i have and worry about the sub??  please give me ideas and help me out. thanks a bunch||||reg||5
Z||000001||sqoach||02-14-2001||05:08 PM||||4x10s don't produce enough bass if you like bass. they're more for midbass/midrange. an 8" sub is a good choice. this is what i did. i checked out a bunch of subs and their specs. when i found a few that i liked, i went to ebay and bid on one or those and got it. that's the way to go if you're on a budget. here's a couple of links to some places that sell some good subs. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.onlinecarstereo.com" TARGET=_blank>www.onlinecarstereo.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.crutchfield.com" TARGET=_blank>www.crutchfield.com</A> <P>pioneer subs are not the best. they do, however, make good head units and pretty good speakers. you can find a pretty good 8" sub for under $100. just gotta search around. i just got a mtx 10" sub and mtx amp for $170 altogether.<P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig2.JPG"> <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily driver)||||reg||10
Z||000002||anthony_86gt||02-14-2001||05:19 PM||||Do I need an amp???  And what should i look for in a 8"?||||reg||5
Z||000003||sqoach||02-14-2001||05:28 PM||||definately need an amp. you need some power to push that sub. did you not have an amp hooked up to that 8" you have? that would be a reason for it not sounding good.<BR>things to look for on subs is the decibel range (dB) frequency range (Hz) and the amount of continual power and peak power (rms vs. peak) it puts out. rms power is usual half of peak or less.<P>here's a really good sub for $89.00<BR>it's the polk audio dx 8"<BR>stimpy has the 10" and he says it sounds very good and puts out plenty of bass. it's a really good choice and not too overly expensive. <A HREF="http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=11169" TARGET=_blank>http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=11169</A> ||||reg||1
